# Work coherence

Before mutating the workspace, tie the ask to something the user is already
trying to achieve:

- An active tracked item (ticket, artifact envelope, backlog entry, plan)
- A named project or domain they own in this workspace
- An explicit goal they stated in the conversation

If none is clear, ask **one** clarifying question before editing.

Domain- or employer-specific framing (what “in scope” means for you) belongs
in **your** workspace or user rules — not in this shared catalog.

## Exempt

`deep-research` (and pure research/reading turns) may explore without a work
link. Everything else that changes files should stay on the coherent picture.

## Skills

Skills are opt-in recipes. Prefer a named skill when the ask matches a catalog
trigger. Do not invent ceremony — if no skill fits, proceed under budgets or
offer `skill-forge` only when the routine will repeat.
